  "description": "PhiliFUR (PF) is a furry art market in Quezon City, Philippines, whose name combines \"Philippines\" and \"fur\". It aims to bring anthropomorphic animals to life through art and fursona cosplay and to give people with shared interests a place to share and create. It began in 2022 as a typical convention at the Elements at Eton Centris, organized by Furry Brigade Convention Management Services, and since 2024 it has been run by Trinity Events Management Co. as an art market at UP Diliman Ang Bahay ng Alumni.",
